language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ coin3_application: an Essence' model from DCP Rosetta.
$
$ Find the minimum number of coins that allows one to pay exactly any amount smaller than a given maximum amount, using a given set of denominations.
$
$ Save this file as model.eprime. Download `coin3_application.json` and `dcp_convert_essence.py` from the
$ problem's page:
$   https://dcp-bench.github.io/DCP-Rosetta/problems/coin3_application.html
$ Convert the instances once, then run the first one with Savile Row 1.11 (it needs Java); the
$ solution is written to `coin3_application_1.param.solution`:
$   python dcp_convert_essence.py coin3_application.json
$   savilerow model.eprime coin3_application_1.param -run-solver

$ number of denominations, derived from the data: the length of denominations (not a field of the reader's JSON)
given denominations_dim1 : int(1..)
$ denominations[j]: value of the coin of type j, indices 1-based
given denominations : matrix indexed by [int(1..denominations_dim1)] of int(1..)
$ max_amount_to_pay: every amount from 1 up to this amount, excluded, must be payable
given max_amount_to_pay : int(2..)

$ x[j]: the number of coins of type j used
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..denominations_dim1)] of int(0..max_amount_to_pay)
$ pay[a,j]: the number of coins of type j used to pay the amount a (auxiliary witness for each amount a)
find pay : matrix indexed by [int(1..max_amount_to_pay - 1), int(1..denominations_dim1)] of int(0..max_amount_to_pay)
$ total: auxiliary, the total number of coins used, which is minimised
find total : int(0..max_amount_to_pay * denominations_dim1)

minimising total
such that
$ the total is the number of coins of all types used
total = (sum j : int(1..denominations_dim1) . x[j]),
$ every amount a below the maximum can be paid exactly with the coins used
forAll a : int(1..max_amount_to_pay - 1) . (sum j : int(1..denominations_dim1) . pay[a,j] * denominations[j]) = a,
$ the coins used to pay an amount are among the coins available
forAll a : int(1..max_amount_to_pay - 1) . forAll j : int(1..denominations_dim1) . pay[a,j] <= x[j]
